{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53471","headline":"过施水庵 · 李谔","name":"过施水庵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胜地开阑若，幽寻信短筇。\n僧贫只施水，客至但闻钟。\n讲坐天花满，香台翠霭重。\n何当谢尘绂，白社此相从。\n（见明李培等万历十四年修《秀水县志》卷八、《檇李诗系》卷三七）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}